### Rider runs these against the API (start it first). The key is your own, from user secrets.
@key = put-your-development-key-here

GET http://localhost:5080/health

###
GET http://localhost:5080/topics
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

###
POST http://localhost:5080/topics
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "cs", "title": "Big O", "confidence": 3 }
